#: ../../source/architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:4
msgid "This page describes the high-level architecture of QuSpect."
msgstr "本页介绍 QuSpect 的高层架构。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:7
msgid "Layered Architecture"
msgstr "分层架构"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:23
msgid "Core Concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:26
msgid "Gate System"
msgstr "门系统"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:28
msgid ""
"Per architecture decision 7.1, gate definitions are separated from matrix"
" computation (:ref:`方案 C <architecture-decision-7-1>`):"
msgstr "根据架构决策 7.1，门定义与矩阵计算相互分离（:ref:`方案 C <architecture-decision-7-1>`）："

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:31
msgid ""
":class:`~quspect.gates.gate.Gate` — Lightweight metadata container (name,"
" num_qubits, label). Hashable, serializable, no numpy dependency."
msgstr ""
":class:`~quspect.gates.gate.Gate` — "
"轻量级元数据容器（name、num_qubits、label）。可哈希、可序列化，不依赖 numpy。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:33
msgid ""
":func:`~quspect.gates._matrix_utils.get_gate_matrix` — Central dispatch "
"for matrix computation. Handles both standard and parameterized gates."
msgstr ""
":func:`~quspect.gates._matrix_utils.get_gate_matrix` — "
"矩阵计算的中心分发函数，同时处理标准门和参数化门。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:37
msgid "Circuit System"
msgstr "线路系统"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:39
msgid ""
":class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit` uses dynamic qubit/clbit"
" count inference (architecture decision 7.0). No need to pre-declare "
"circuit size — it grows automatically as qubits are referenced."
msgstr ""
":class:`~quspect.circuit.circuit.QuantumCircuit` 动态推断量子比特/经典比特的数量（架构决策 "
"7.0）。无需预先声明线路规模——线路会随着量子比特被引用而自动增长。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:43
msgid ""
"Measurements are represented as "
":class:`~quspect.circuit.instruction.InstructionType` rather than as Gate"
" subclasses (architecture decision 7.3), since measurement is a "
"projective operation, not a unitary transformation."
msgstr ""
"测量以 :class:`~quspect.circuit.instruction.InstructionType` 表示，而不是作为 Gate "
"的子类（架构决策 7.3），因为测量是投影操作，而不是幺正变换。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:48
msgid "DAG System"
msgstr "DAG 系统"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:50
msgid ""
"The Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) is QuSpect's primary intermediate "
"representation. The compiler converts sequential circuit instructions "
"into a dependency graph that explicitly models qubit/clbit data flow."
msgstr "有向无环图（DAG）是 QuSpect 的主要中间表示。编译器将顺序排列的线路指令转换为依赖图，显式建模量子比特/经典比特的数据流。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:54
msgid "Time complexity: O(n + m) where n = num_qubits, m = instructions"
msgstr "时间复杂度：O(n + m)，其中 n = num_qubits，m = 指令数"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:55
msgid "Supports topological ordering and layer partitioning for scheduling"
msgstr "支持拓扑排序和分层划分，用于调度"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:58
msgid "Architecture Decisions"
msgstr "架构决策"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:63
msgid "7.0: Dynamic Qubit Count"
msgstr "7.0：动态量子比特数量"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Decision**: ``QuantumCircuit()`` does not accept a qubit count "
"parameter. ``num_qubits`` and ``num_clbits`` are inferred from actual "
"usage (``max(index) + 1``)."
msgstr ""
"**决策**：``QuantumCircuit()`` 不接受量子比特数量参数。``num_qubits`` 和 ``num_clbits`` "
"根据实际使用情况推断（``max(index) + 1``）。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:72
msgid "7.1: Gate — Definition vs. Matrix Separation"
msgstr "7.1：Gate——定义与矩阵分离"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Decision**: 方案 C. Gate is a pure metadata container. Matrix computation"
" is handled by standalone functions in ``_matrix_utils.py``. This keeps "
"gate definitions lightweight, hashable, and free from numpy serialization"
" issues."
msgstr ""
"**决策**：方案 C。Gate 是纯元数据容器。矩阵计算由 ``_matrix_utils.py`` "
"中的独立函数处理。这使门定义保持轻量、可哈希，且不受 numpy 序列化问题影响。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:80
msgid "7.2: Instruction Storage"
msgstr "7.2：指令存储"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Decision**: 方案 A. Simple ``list[CircuitInstruction]`` for Phase 1. "
"Indexed access can be added later if performance requires."
msgstr ""
"**决策**：方案 A。第一阶段（Phase 1）使用简单的 "
"``list[CircuitInstruction]``。如果性能需要，之后可以增加索引访问。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:86
msgid "7.3: Measurement Representation"
msgstr "7.3：测量表示"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Decision**: 方案 B. Measurement is an ``InstructionType``, not a Gate "
"subclass. This correctly models the fact that measurement is a projective"
" (non-unitary) operation."
msgstr "**决策**：方案 B。测量是一种 ``InstructionType``，而不是 Gate 子类。这正确地反映了测量是投影（非幺正）操作这一事实。"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:93
msgid "7.4: Parameter Storage"
msgstr "7.4：参数存储"

#: ../../source/architecture.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Decision**: 方案 B. ``params: tuple[float | Parameter, ...]`` — supports "
"both concrete numeric values and symbolic parameters."
msgstr "**决策**：方案 B。``params: tuple[float | Parameter, ...]``——同时支持具体数值和符号参数。"

